[by:伤感咩吖]
[00:00.00]作词 : DPR IAN
[00:00.99]作曲 : DPR IAN
[00:01.99]Dear Insanity 致疯狂
[00:04.61]
[00:07.89]If you are reading this 倘若你正阅读
[00:10.37]We have ventured too far off into our minds 我们的想法已走太远
[00:14.21]And everything that we thought was a dream 我们所认为是梦境的
[00:18.46]Is now real 如今皆为现实
[00:20.29]
[00:21.86]Even the nightmares 尽管有噩梦存在
[00:25.04]My time is running out 我的时间即将流逝
[00:28.39]But yours has just begun 但你的刚刚开始
[00:33.91]But don't worry 但不要担心
[00:36.32]I'll find a way to come back 我会找到回去的路
[00:40.21]I always do 总会如此
[00:41.47]
[00:44.03]Yours truly 此致 敬礼